 193          /*
 194           *--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 195           * void  STORAGE_Init_Read(U16_T readlen,U8_T *readbuf,U8_T master)
 196           * Purpose : Read the Flash content into KVM_Flash
 197           * Params  : $readlen : length to read
